      "worked": "Opposite angles are supplementary, so $C=180^\\circ-A$ and $D=180^\\circ-B$. Hence $\\cos C=-\\cos A$ and $\\cos D=-\\cos B$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos A+\\cos B+\\cos C+\\cos D&=\\cos A+\\cos B-\\cos A-\\cos B\\\\\\cos A+\\cos B+\\cos C+\\cos D&=0.\\end{align*}$$",
